  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "由 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B D { \\cong } \\triangle A C D"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，还可得出 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle B A D = \\angle C A D , \\angle B D A = \\angle C D A"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，从而 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A D \\perp B C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "．这也就证明了等腰三角形ABC底边上的中线AD平分顶角 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle A"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "并垂直于底边BC.用类似的方法，还可以证明等腰三角形顶角的平分线平分底边并且垂直于底边，底边上的高平分顶角并且平分底边．这也就证明了等腰三角形“三线合一”."
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        122,
        67,
        916,
        203
      ],
      "reading_order": 1,
      "original_image_bbox": [
